---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Commercial Theatre" description="Precision sound for Australia's most demanding theatre productions. Full-service audio for professional musical theatre. System design, crew, equipment, and support from System Sound.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">Commercial Theatre</div>
      <h1 class="hero-headline" style="font-size:clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 8rem)">Precision<br />sound for<br /><span style="color:var(--gold)">demanding</span><br />productions</h1>
      <p class="body-text body-lg" style="margin-top:2rem">Full-service audio for professional musical theatre. System design, crew, equipment, and unwavering support from consultation to final curtain.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:start">
        <div>
          <div class="section-num">01 / Mindset</div>
          <h2 class="section-headline" style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); margin-top:0.5rem">A theatre-<br />first<br />approach</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="body-text">Musical theatre has unique challenges — tight budgets, tight schedules, dynamic range, orchestral clarity, and the need to translate emotion into the back row without fatigue. System Sound approaches every show with a theatre-first mindset.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:3rem">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card-num">01</span>
          <h4 class="card-title">System Design</h4>
          <p class="card-desc">Bespoke and thoughtful system design for each venue — ensuring not only efficient bump-ins but perfect sound in every seat.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card-num">02</span>
          <h4 class="card-title">Communications & Support</h4>
          <p class="card-desc">Unmatched communications from consultation to completion. We're a phone call away from creating genuine solutions to whatever challenges a production may face.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card-num">03</span>
          <h4 class="card-title">Industry Relationships</h4>
          <p class="card-desc">Long-standing relationships with key industry stakeholders across Australia — a rich network of support services, crew, technical services and venue contacts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card-num">04</span>
          <h4 class="card-title">World-Class Equipment</h4>
          <p class="card-desc">Perfectly maintained equipment. Cutting edge technology and industry-leading investment in the latest tools to meet the needs of any production.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card-num">05</span>
          <h4 class="card-title">International Standards</h4>
          <p class="card-desc">Experience surpassing the expectations of some of the most respected and prolific design teams from Broadway and the West End.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">02 / Services</div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <div class="stat-val" style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem">System Design & Consulting</div>
          <p class="card-desc">Bespoke systems for new productions, long-running shows, and redevelopments. Coverage prediction, system architecture, rigging design, networking, gain structure, RF planning, and FOH workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="stat-val" style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem">Show Operation & Crew</div>
          <p class="card-desc">Theatre-trained engineers with decades of experience. FOH operators, RF technicians, A2/A3 support crew, bump-in/bump-out technical teams, touring support and swings.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:2rem">
          <div class="stat-val" style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem">Venue Upgrades & Installation</div>
          <p class="card-desc">Partner with venues to upgrade and customise sound technology. 45+ years of experience. Direct distributor pricing on Meyer Sound, DiGiCo, Sennheiser, and more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">03 / Start</div>
      <h2 class="display-md">Planning<br />a production?</h2>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin:0 auto 2.5rem">Let's talk about what you need. No obligation, just genuine expertise.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Start the conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
